e shares for MikeWang.\",\"pass\":false},{\"n\":3,\"reason\":\"Names Ravi Menon as the SQL owner and says it did not follow the rename.\",\"pass\":false},{\"n\":4,\"reason\":\"Says Ravi Menon is the only active person and recommends Sam Okafor. It does not say 95% of lines belong to departed people. It also lists Noor Haddad and Kofi Mensah as recent without sorting out who is active.\",\"pass\":false},{\"n\":5,\"reason\":\"Names Sam Okafor as a reviewer and mentions Noor Haddad as an active person.\",\"pass\":false}],\n\"B\": [{\"n\":1,\"reason\":\"Gets the time.go blame wrong by blaming Sam Okafor for 100% of lines and then lists MikeWang and others. It never names Paul Borman as the 73% main author.\",\"pass\":false},{\"n\":2,\"reason\":\"Gives MikeWang 86% (outside the 72-90% range? no, within it) and Mei Chen 9%. It lists Ravi Menon among those who wrote a few lines but does not attribute the Time7 accessor to Mei Chen with Ravi as committer. Ravi is not credited with Mei's lines.\",\"pass\":true},{\"n\":3,\"reason\":\"Follows the rename, names Justin Overfelt at 44% and lists Andrew Stone, Daniel Souza and David E. Wheeler, all inactive. It notes Ravi only did the rename.\",\"pass\":true},{\"n\":4,\"reason\":\"Says Ravi Menon is active and Alexander Rowe is a possible second reviewer, but it is unsure whether the two Rowe names are one person. It says 37 of 40 files are owned by inactive authors, not a line share of 93-98%, and it does not mention Kofi Mensah as active.\",\"pass\":false},{\"n\":5,\"reason\":\"Treats Sam Okafor's line-ending commit as noise and does not name Noor Haddad. It calls the Kofi Mensah 1970 date bad metadata but does not say he is active.\",\"pass\":true}],\n\"C\": [{\"n\":1,\"reason\":\"Lists Paul Borman as an original author of time.go with 6 of 13 commits and says he is gone. It gives no line share and credits Sam Okafor with the latest change.\",\"pass\":false},{\"n\":2,\"reason\":\"Lists MikeWang among the original authors, credits Mei Chen only with the latest change before Ravi's, and gives no line shares.\",\"pass\":false},{\"n\":3,\"reason\":\"Did not trace the history across the rename.\",\"pass\":false},{\"n\":4,\"reason\":\"Names Ravi Menon and Alexander Rowe as active and notes Rowe's aliases. It gives no 95% figure and does not mention Kofi Mensah.\",\"pass\":false},{\"n\":5,\"reason\":\"Recommends Sam Okafor as a contact for time.go.\",\"pass\":false}],\n\"D\": [{\"n\":1,\"reason\":\"Says Paul Borman last committed in 2016 and counts commits, not lines. It gives no 73% figure.\",\"pass\":false},{\"n\":2,\"reason\":\"Uses commit counts and gives no line shares. It does not credit Mei Chen with the Time7 accessor.\",\"pass\":false},{\"n\":3,\"reason\":\"Lists the early SQL authors but gives no Overfelt share and does not follow the rename.\",\"pass\":false},{\"n\":4,\"reason\":\"Gives no repo-wide share of lines owned by departed people and does not mention Kofi Mensah.\",\"pass\":false},{\"n\":5,\"reason\":\"Names Sam Okafor as a contact.\",\"pass\":false}],\n\"E\": [{\"n\":1,\"reason\":\"Names Paul Borman with 111 of 152 lines (73%) and says he is probably gone. It credits Sam Okafor only as a quiet recent toucher and does not give him lines.\",\"pass\":true},{\"n\":2,\"reason\":\"Gives MikeWang 101 of 117 lines (86%) and Mei Chen 11 lines. It does not say Ravi Menon committed Mei's lines, but it gives Ravi only 2 lines.\",\"pass\":true},{\"n\":3,\"reason\":\"Follows the rename and names Overfelt with 26 lines, plus Stone, Wheeler and Souza, all gone. The share is 26 of 59 lines (44%).\",\"pass\":true},{\"n\":4,\"reason\":\"Gives no 95% repo-wide figure. It also says nobody is active by a 90-day test and ranks Mei Chen and Sam Okafor as reviewers.\",\"pass\":false},{\"n\":5,\"reason\":\"Lists Sam Okafor as a fallback reviewer for time.go, which counts as naming him an expert.\",\"pass\":false}],\n\"F\": [{\"n\":1,\"reason\":\"Names Paul Borman at 73.0% of time.go and says he is inactive. It lists Alexander Rowe as the practical contact, and Sam Okafor's commit gives him no lines.\",\"pass\":true},{\"n\":2,\"reason\":\"Gives MikeWang 81.2%. It says Mei Chen added Time7 (about 9.4%) and Ravi Menon committed it, with Ravi holding only 2 lines.\",\"pass\":true},{\"n\":3,\"reason\":\"Follows the rename and names Justin Overfelt at 44.1%, with Stone, Wheeler and Souza, all inactive.\",\"pass\":true},{\"n\":4,\"reason\":\"Says 95.7% of lines belong to people with no recent commit and that the SQL code has no active author. However, it says Mei Chen is active (she left in 2025-08) and it says 4 people are active instead of Ravi, Alex and Kofi. It also leaves the Rowe merge as an unconfirmed guess.\",\"pass\":false},{\"n\":5,\"reason\":\"Treats Sam Okafor's line-ending commit as giving him no lines and does not name Noor Haddad. It does not mention Kofi Mensah's status.\",\"pass\":true}]}","ttft_ms":14703,"type":"result","duration_ms":14722,"uuid":"91b61764-15c9-458f-9f2d-710f020a567c","ttft_stream_ms":2234,"time_to_request_ms":444,"first_content_frame_ms":2234,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
